      m_Calls: []
  m_text: "<color=#42D9A3>\xBB</color>  <b>Runtime API:</b> follow.SetTarget(t),
    SetPositionSpeed(v), SetPositionSmoothMode(Follow.SmoothMode.Lerp), SetDeadzoneEnabled(true),
    TeleportToTarget(); events onStartFollowing, onStopFollowing, onTargetLost.\n<color=#42D9A3>\xBB</color> 
    <b>Scene workflow:</b> Select a follower: target, smoothing, deadzone, limits
    and events are Inspector fields. The speed slider, deadzone toggle and Teleport
    button call Follow directly through persistent UnityEvents.\n<color=#42D9A3>\xBB</color> 
    <b>Verification:</b> Hold the mouse in the scene to drag Target (MouseMover2D).
    Drop target logs onTargetLost; Teleport keeps Rail Follower on its rail."
